  "prefLabel": "Ph 2006.06 Inspections",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 2006.06 Inspections.\n\n(a) Outsourcing facilities shall be subject to inspections by the FDA on a risk-based schedule.\n\n(b) Information that is considered to contain trade secrets or which might be proprietary in nature shall be protected from public disclosure.\n\nSource. #12336, eff 7-22-17",
